# pooling smoke — PR gate: the algorithm x parameter families
#
# Shape column = the case's view: MxNxK with
#   M = mb*OH, N = OW, K = 1
# and the params column carries the pooling geometry: an optional leading
# algorithm name (max | avg = avg_include | avgex = avg_exclude; default
# max) followed by the fixed key order
#   mb,ic,ih,iw,kh,kw[,sh,sw][,pt,pb,pl,pr]
# (see tests/inputs/README.md). The two columns must agree; a mismatch is a
# parse error.
#
#   OH = (ih + pt + pb - kh)/sh + 1   (OW likewise)
#
# f32 is bit-exact against the scalar golden; f16/bf16 compare at the dtype
# trait tolerance (exact up-conversion, fp32 accumulation).
